// SaysList :
"P3523521640" "<t 3><t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown> {HeroName}, stay your hand for a moment.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>It is my belief that Dr. Graves is merely attempting to clear witnesses to his game.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>The time to strike, I think, is fast approaching. See if you can procure Zephyr's cooperation in this matter.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>He will be a far more valuable resource to us if he remains in his current form."
// SaysList :
"P3749242885" "<t=5><t=4 caption x=0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkCyan>Ok, so maybe you didn't catch it the first, oh hundred times. I'll make it clear for you.<t=1 caption x=0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 2><color white><bgcolor DarkCyan>I'M<t=1 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 2><color white><bgcolor DarkCyan>THE<t=1 caption x=0.4 y=0.3 d=4><scale 2><color white><bgcolor DarkCyan>FREAKING<t=1 caption x=0.5 y=0.3 d=4><scale 2><color white><bgcolor DarkCyan>WIND<t=1 caption x=0.6 y=0.3 d=4><scale 2><color white><bgcolor DarkCyan>BRO.<t=4 caption x=0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 2><color white><bgcolor DarkCyan>You should just give up and go home. Like, now."

