// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2081516150" "Return to the Fateweaver"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P873411535" "The Fateweaver has demanded that you return to her once your task is complete. Again, I must warn you, do not reveal too much.  A Fateweaver learning of our contest would be disastrous."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P881475141" "The Fateweaver offered you power, but warned of great risks as well."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1389148932" "So, you return. Our benefactor has decided that reducing Zephyr to a harmless gust of wind is sufficient. Most importantly, Zephyr has been removed as a connection between our benefactor and these illicit games.<br><br>Your next task will not be easy, but it should require less... creativity this time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Facemaker 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P512692464" "Welcome to Facemaker! We have everything on hand it takes to make a new you!"
// Answer Text :
"P1103124188" "I bet you say that to everyone that comes in here."
// Page Everyone Text :
"P940753355" "Well of course I do. Did you expect that I would treat you extra-special just because you-<br><br><color orange>The Facemaker stops short, eyeing you suspiciously.</color><br><br>Wait... you're not here for a makeover, are you? What do you want? Why are you here?"
// Answer Text :
"P1742283623" "I need to know if someone named Omnicore has requested your services."
// Page Requested Text :
"P1950580213" "And why would I tell you something like that? I happen to respect a little thing called doctor-patient confidentiality!<br><br>Besides, if I went around blabbing about every operation I've ever done, then Villains like you wouldn't ever use my services, then, would they? No sense in getting a new face if everyone knows what it looks like!"
// Answer Text :
"P2274317102" "Villains like me?"
// Page Villains Text :
"P416633886" "Of course! Some come in wanting to flee the authorities, others just want to look more imposing... whatever it is, I can make it happen. My surgical team is the best in the business, and you can take that to the bank!<br><br>Well, you probably wouldn't want to... the bank here in Cap keeps getting robbed. But that's not the point, is it?<br><br>What I'm getting at is that I don't reveal patient history. To <i>anyone</i>. Got it?"
// Answer Text :
"P1244023256" "Let's start over. Hi, I'm the Face Unmaker. I'm about to unmake your face..."
// Page Unmaker Text :
"P1452113497" "Now, now, there's no need for that. Calm down.<br><br><color orange>The Facemaker ponders her predicament. After a moment, she grins at you.</color><br><br>I've had a change in policy. I still won't reveal my patient history, but technically the lady you're talking about wasn't ever a patient. She came in for a consultation, that's all."
// Answer Text :
"P201431225" "Really? Do tell."
// Page DoTell Text :
"P1448144004" "She wanted me to make her unrecognizable. She said she had some nasty people after her - I assume that's you - and she needed to disappear for a while.<br><br>I told her I could do it, but when we reached the point where she had to take off her gear, she refused. The crazy woman threw a fit right here in my studio, screaming about how we were trying to 'take her power away' or something. She's a loony, that one.<br><br>After that, she stalked out muttering something about robbing a bank. That's the last I saw of her."
// Answer Text :
"P1004592974" "Hmm. Alright. See you around, Facemaker."
// Page SeeYou Text :
"P1556291909" "<color orange>The Facemaker wrinkles her nose at you.</color><br><br>Yeah? Well, next time maybe you can get some work done. I don't much care for traffic that isn't business. Understand?"
// Answer Text :
"P2787317035" "Whatever."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Broker 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2361184104" "Ya? What do you want? I do not know you, and I am not sure what you could want from ME."
// Answer Text :
"P817767521" "I'm here for information, Boris. I'm looking for a woman named Omnicore."
// Page Omnicore Text :
"P3638041252" "Omni...core? I do not know this name. I know many names, but I do not know this one.<br><br>I am sorry that I could not help you further."
// Answer Text :
"P2729611040" "Maybe if I described her? Silver armor, perpetual scowl, bad temperament..."
// Page SilverArmor Text :
"P906073484" "Hmm... Silver armor...?<br><br><color orange>Boris's brow furrows in concentration. He looks up suddenly, and bursts into bellowing laughter.</color><br><br>Ha HAAAA ha ha ha! You are talking about my little Lapushka!"
// Answer Text :
"P828176239" "Your little... Lapushka?"
// Page Lapushka Text :
"P1272781418" "Yes, yes! I have known her a very long time. I did not know she gave herself a name, but her demeanor is unmistakable.<br><br>The person you describe, it must be her!"
// Answer Text :
"P166314047" "And she lets you call her that?"
// Page CallHer Text :
"P3132855239" "HA ha ha, no! She tells me she will kill me every time I call her this. And yet I am still here, so she must not hate it as much as she says, yes?<br><br>Lapushka was here very recently, in fact. She told me that she needed money quickly, and when you need money quickly, you speak to Boris!<br><br><color orange>Boris's chest puffs up with pride.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3844787585" "Right... so you gave her some money?"
// Page Money Text :
"P900345547" "No no no no! I do not give money so easily, ha ha! What I give are jobs!<br><br>My Lapushka and I, we have an... understanding, yes? If I see a good opportunity, perhaps a good heist, this is when I speak with her. I give her the job, she brings back the money, and we both take our share. It is... how you say... mutually beneficial arrangement."
// Answer Text :
"P2286575050" "I see. So she needed money, robbed a bank... then what?"
// Page ThenWhat Text :
"P558698175" "<color orange>Boris shrugs at you.</color><br><br>We split our shares and she went on her way. I am sure she needed the money for all of the little gizmos she is constantly making. Terrible little things, things that could make a grown man soil himself! Ha ha ha...<br><br><color orange>Boris shakes his head, smiling fondly.</color><br><br>My Lapushka is always making these things. One time she..."
// Answer Text :
"P1370001357" "I'm pretty sure I'm done talking with you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Store 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P224349368" "Speak, citizen. What is it that you want from me?"
// Answer Text :
"P2164431549" "I, uh, I was wondering if an armored woman came by recently to purchase parts from you?"
// Page Parts Text :
"P2892172449" "Yes, there was a woman of that description who purchased from me recently. I believe her name was Omnicore."
// Answer Text :
"P2817537731" "Oh! Well then. That was easier than I thought."
// Page Easy Text :
"P4104888787" "No problem, citizen. I'm happy to share my transaction history with you, free of charge.<br><br><color orange>A sinister grin appears on the Quartermaster's face.</color><br><br>Of course, Omnicore made some very high-end purchases from me. She seemed to be putting some dangerous tech together. Why, if I were you, I would think twice about confronting her.<br><br>At least, equipped as you are now."
// Answer Text :
"P1300943837" "As I am now? What do you mean?"
// Page AsIAm Text :
"P308788634" "Why, I merely meant to suggest that, since Omnicore spent a small fortune on the devices I sold her, she probably has something very sinister planned. You might not be able to handle whatever she's got in store for you.<br><br>On the other hand, I have a number of devices that might be able to bolster your own powers. With these, you might become a match for Omnicore, and you might be able to survive your upcoming encounter."
// Answer Text :
"P3333543095" "Wait, are you serious? You're trying to get me to buy from you?"
// Page BuyFromYou Text :
"P4090185519" "Well, I <i>suppose</i> if your powers don't interact properly with my inventory, another Quartermaster might be more appropriate for your needs. And, truly, you're not required to purchase anything from anyone.<br><br>I'm merely stating that your chances would be greater if your powers were operating at optimum capacity. If you don't enhance them properly, then you won't stand a chance."
// Answer Text :
"P1037606168" "Okay, okay, I get it. Can you tell me where Omnicore went after she bought from you?"
// Page Went Text :
"P2127171449" "Luckily for you, I plant tracking devices on all of my merchandise. I'll even give you her coordinates, free of charge. Now all you have to worry about is not dying when you meet her.<br><br>Remember, citizen. If you need the strength to succeed, Arachnos can help... for a price."
// Answer Text :
"P4001131767" "Yeah. I've been hearing that a lot lately."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Omnicore 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2477950815" "Finish it, {HeroName}. I will not sit idly by while you gloat over my defeat."
// Answer Text :
"P860697140" "I don't recall ever taking orders from you, Omnicore."
// Page Orders Text :
"P3874423591" "Hrmph. So you insist upon delaying your triumph so that you may insult me further? Typical. I shall never understand how I could be beaten by someone so trivial as you."
// Answer Text :
"P605607020" "Tempting, to be sure. But, alas, I did not come here to kill you."
// Page Tempting Text :
"P3911684100" "<color orange>Omnicore falls silent, genuinely shocked by your statement.</color><br><br>I would suspect you of trickery if I thought you had any further advantage to gain, {HeroName}. Explain yourself."
// Answer Text :
"P3216249619" "How do you feel about Dr. Graves, Omnicore?"
// Page Graves Text :
"P2390530573" "My hatred for Dr. Graves is overshadowed only by my hatred of you, {HeroName}. That the two of you combined efforts to see my downfall is the greatest shame I have endured."
// Answer Text :
"P2485756118" "That's what I thought. How would you like to kill him for me?"
// Page KillHim Text :
"P2880812014" "How would I-<br><br>Well, {HeroName}. You are more devious than I originally thought. If the price of my life is participation in the murder of Dr. Graves, I will gladly accept.<br><br><color orange>You can feel Omnicore's glare from behind her faceplate.</color><br><br>But know this, {HeroName}. The moment Graves falls, you and I will be sworn enemies once more. Do not expect me to forget your transgressions against me.<br><br>Mark my words: I will be the last thing you ever see."
// Answer Text :
"P1207343793" "I wouldn't have it any other way, Omnicore."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2513537401" "The next target in your murderous victory lap will be Omnicore. You should know that I specifically requested that she become your next target. I'm sure the wait has been <i>killing</i> you.<br><br>Unfortunately for us, it seems that Omnicore has gone into hiding. I am not aware of her current location. However...<br><br><color orange>For a moment, you see a flash of what might have been a smirk from Dr. Graves.</color><br><br>It is much harder to disappear in the Rogue Isles than most realize.<br><br>"
// AcceptString :
"P4062374223" "Oh? Do you have a way to track her?"
// SendOffString :
"P4183186846" "Not quite. I simply know what would be necessary for someone to truly vanish in this lawless place.<br><br>For instance, in order to not be discovered, Omnicore will likely attempt to change her appearance, if she has not already done so. Thus, she would be drawn to the services of the Facemakers, whose surgical skills are nearly on par with my own.<br><br>Seek out the Facemakers, and I am sure you will find Omnicore's trail. Pursue it relentlessly, trace it to the end, and when you find Omnicore...<br><br><color orange>Dr. Graves's face remains motionless, but his eyes glint with murderous glee.</color><br><br>Kill her. Slowly."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3737522422" "<color deepskyblue>Core Values</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3115574049" "Speak to the Facemaker"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P818404281" "If you tarry, the trail may run cold. I would suggest you speak with the Facemaker before Omnicore eludes your grasp entirely."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4251699375" "Omnicore apparently intended to rob a bank. You're not sure why, but you ARE sure she would have needed help."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P489857339" "Find Omnicore's Liaison"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P202255331" "So, Omnicore's pride has prevented her from partaking in the Facemaker's services. This is convenient for us, but we still do not know her current location.<br><br>Even for Omnicore, assaulting a bank vault is no easy task. She must have gained assistance from someone. Find that person, and I'm sure you'll find Omnicore."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P974644841" "You learned a little about Omnicore's past, but you still have yet to find her whereabouts."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P204624832" "Speak to the Technology Quartermaster"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2843664928" "As amusing as Omnicore's relationship with Boris may be, it still doesn't indicate where she might be.<br><br>You said she left to purchase... 'gizmos'? If she intended to acquire advanced technology, she would have needed Arachnos's help. See if you can trace her purchases."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2347498492" "The Quartermaster showed you exactly where Omnicore's base is!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3179991287" "Find and Defeat Omnicore"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3588724227" "So, the Quartermaster has given you her location, has he? Excellent.<br><br>I would be wary, {HeroName}. Based on Omnicore's recent activities, I would not be surprised if she were expecting you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
