// SaysList :
"P988382272" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown> {HeroName}. Be advised that Omnicore's base is currently draining a large amount of power from the Aeon City grid.<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>I do not know what she has planned for you, but I expect that it will not be pleasant.<t=10 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>As with Zephyr, please set aside any rivalries you harbor with Omnicore. She would be a valuable asset in your campaign against Graves.<t=20 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color black><bgcolor gray>So, {HeroName}! You have finally arrived. Allow me to greet you... personally.<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>It is as I feared. She has created shield generators that prevent all incoming harm.<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>If you wish to defeat her, {HeroName}, you must first destroy the generators. Then she will become vulnerable to your attacks."

