// Variable - Dialog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - DialogStartPage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SaysList :
"P1681879665" "{HeroName}? You are not part of the game.<t 2>But, if you'd like, I could include you..."
// SaysList :
"P2729895599" "Where aaaaaarrrreeeee yooooouuuu?<t 1>Come out and plaaaaaaayyyyyy..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3451510195" "You managed to convince Crosscut to help you take down Dr. Graves."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2674846784" "So, {HeroName}. You are alive.<br><br>I will be honest, I did not expect you to survive your encounter with Crosscut. He was a dangerous man - far more dangerous, I think, than the other contestants realized. I expected him to win the Killing Game by a wide margin.<br><br>And yet, you beat him in the contest, and you have beaten him in personal combat. I have underestimated you, {HeroName}. You are far more formidable than I originally estimated. You may be just the {Hero.gender=male man|woman} I've been waiting for."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Graves 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2705277706" "{HeroName}... I would congratulate you, but my demise will be a blessing compared to what is in store for you."
// Answer Text :
"P2868464881" "You're not really in a good position to make threats, Graves."
// Page Threats Text :
"P2206213934" "<color orange>For the first time since you've known him, you hear Dr. Graves laugh. It is not a sound you enjoy.</color><br><br>It is no threat, fool. It is a reality you have not yet been made aware of. There is <b><i>so much</i></b> you do not yet know, I almost pity you.<br><br>You are, quite simply, doomed."
// Answer Text :
"P1915677508" "Explain, then. I'm listening."
// Page Explain Text :
"P1157301828" "At this point I'm sure you believe that our vaunted benefactor does not exist, and that I have been running this contest myself.<br><br>On the first point, you would be correct. No benefactor exists to offer you the power you were promised. I should think that would be fairly obvious by now.<br><br>However, I am most certainly not the ringleader of this little circus. I am merely a pawn... in <i>her</i> game.<br><br>Your suspicions have been misspent, {HeroName}. I was not the one you should have been wary of."
// Answer Text :
"P3636929911" "'Her game'? Wait, you can't be serious..."
// Page Really Text :
"P3924154053" "<color orange>Dr. Graves's laughter devolves into sputtering and coughing.</color><br><br><i><b>Fool.</b></i> Even after she has been revealed, you continue to underestimate Dollface. She... <b><i>it</i></b> is capable of horrors you have never dreamed of.<br><br>She started this contest to find a body, {HeroName}. Hers is deteriorating, and my surgical skills have their limits. Your reward for victory was to be eternal torment, trapped within a body you do not control.<br><br>Abandon all hope, {HeroName}. She is a being as ancient as these very Isles we stand upon. You have no chance of defeating her.<br><br>"
// Answer Text :
"P2013667811" "Perhaps not... at least, not alone."
// Page Alone Text :
"P3276395813" "<color orange>Graves stares at you silently. You match his gaze without faltering.</color><br><br>I am not sure that even our combined efforts could defeat her, {HeroName}. However, she has already chosen your body for conquest.<br><br>As it stands now, I have nothing to lose. I either die here, by your hand, or die by hers. I believe Omnicore and Zephyr are in similar predicaments. If you wish me to stand with you against her - against that infernal terror - then I will do so."
// Answer Text :
"P3495408554" "Very well. But remember, Graves - I'm running the show from now on."
// Page ImInCharge Text :
"P4015871540" "<color orange>Graves's eyes flare with resentment, but he makes no protest.</color><br><br>As you wish, {HeroName}. We shall follow your lead.<br><br>...For now."
// Answer Text :
"P75861990" "Good enough, Graves. Good enough."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2878715053" "Your final task is at hand, {HeroName}. Dollface may appear to be-<br><br><color orange>Dr. Graves's words fall upon deaf ears as the voice of Scirocco fills your head.</color><br><br><color yellow>It is time, {HeroName}. It is my belief that by the time you find Dollface, Dr. Graves will have already made his escape.<br><br>I have been tracking Graves's recent movements - his base of operations appears to be a warehouse on the outskirts of Cap au Diable. Assemble your compatriots and ambush him there.<br><br>This is the task for which Arachnos has left you alive, {HeroName}. Failure on your part <b>will</b> be fatal."
// AcceptString :
"P3045060298" "I'd best not fail, then."
// SendOffString :
"P3719380850" "<color orange>You are again capable of hearing Dr. Graves.</color><br><br>What? Yes... this is true, {HeroName}. Failure is not an option. I am glad you appreciate the seriousness of this matter.<br><br>Dollface will be waiting for you. Proceed with the utmost caution."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3761997084" "Ambush Dr. Graves!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2702737891" "You are very close to achieving great power, {HeroName}. Do not falter now."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1278853445" "<color deepskyblue>Grave Consequences</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1508069126" "You've called in the ambush. Your allies should be here somewhere. It's time to finish this."

